  "privacyHData": "Your game data",
  "privacyPData": "Arrowtile doesn’t need an account. Your progress (levels, stars, coins and settings) is stored only on your device and is never sent to us (apart from the anonymous statistics described below). Apart from ads, purchases and anonymous analytics/crash reports, the game doesn’t connect to the internet. This game is not directed at children under 13.",
  "privacyHAds": "Ads",
  "privacyPAds": "In the Android version, ads are shown by Google AdMob. AdMob may collect data such as the advertising ID, IP address, device and app information and ad interactions to show and measure ads and to prevent fraud. In the European Economic Area, the UK and Switzerland you are asked for consent before personalised ads, and you can change your choice at any time. You can reset or delete your advertising ID in your device settings. You can learn how Google uses data from partner sites or apps at: https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites",
  "privacyHAnalytics": "Analytics and crash reports",
  "privacyPAnalytics": "Arrowtile uses Google Firebase Analytics and Firebase Crashlytics to improve the game. Firebase Analytics collects anonymous usage statistics: level progress (starts, completions, stars, mistakes, hints, time), ad and purchase events, settings such as language and theme, and device and app information (model, OS version, app version, truncated IP address for approximate location). Firebase Crashlytics collects crash reports: device model, OS version, stack traces and an installation ID. The purposes are tuning the game’s difficulty, finding bugs and improving stability. We do not collect your name, email address or free-text input; this data is not linked to your identity and is not used for ad personalisation. Google acts as a processor on our behalf. In the European Economic Area, the UK and Switzerland, analytics only runs if you give consent, and you can change your choice at any time in the privacy options. Crash reports are sent to keep the app stable. More information: https://firebase.google.com/support/privacy",
  "privacyHBuy": "Purchases",
  "privacyPBuy": "The “Remove ads” purchase is handled by Google Play. Your payment details never reach us; the game only learns whether the purchase is valid.",
